goto (1.0.0-1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Initial release.
  * Register, delete, list, and resolve directory shortcuts.
  * Subpath navigation (goto name/subpath).
  * Cleanup command to remove broken shortcuts.
  * Rename shortcuts.
  * Import/export shortcuts for backup and migration.
  * Shell integration for Bash, Zsh, and Fish.
  * Tab completion with subpath support.
  * XDG Base Directory compliance.
  * Man page.

 -- Psalms Christopher Matovu <psalmschristophermatovu@gmail.com>  Thu, 29 May 2025 00:00:00 +0000
